<v Sarah Okafor>Forklifts as well — I'll do the pre-use checks on the forklifts first thing tomorrow, normal priority. Saz can pick that up.</v>

00:03:11.819 --> 00:03:13.919
<v Callum Reid>Cheers, that'll help days get moving.</v>

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:24.020
<v Grace Liu>On safety, I'll do the lock-out tag-out sign-off on the boiler safety valve today. It's urgent, so I'll get on that straight after this.</v>

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.689
<v Sarah Okafor>Perfect, thanks Grace.</v>

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.979
