<v Jamie Brennan>Yep, works for me.</v>

00:04:34.639 --> 00:04:43.040
<v Sarah Okafor>Callum, can you book a contractor to look at the Compressed Air Dryer at half two? Not an emergency but don't let it slip.</v>

00:04:45.089 --> 00:04:50.689
<v Callum Reid>Yeah, alright, I'll book a contractor to look at the Compressed Air Dryer at half two.</v>

00:04:52.639 --> 00:04:54.040
<v Marcus Hale>Half two today, yeah?</v>

