00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.290
<v Tomasz Nowak>Already crossed it off, mate.</v>

00:05:56.819 --> 00:06:02.420
<v Jamie Brennan>I've got procurement bits, but no fresh actions for today beyond the line two downtime one.</v>

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.430
