00:06:39.389 --> 00:06:43.589
<v Tomasz Nowak>I've got the seal kit in the cage still, by the way.</v>

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.819
<v Sarah Okafor>Even better.</v>

00:06:48.209 --> 00:06:56.259
<v Jamie Brennan>And Sarah, on the handover report, by the 28th means today obviously, so if you ping it before lunch that'll save me chasing.</v>

00:06:57.319 --> 00:06:59.069
<v Sarah Okafor>Yep, by the 28th, understood.</v>

00:06:59.779 --> 00:07:04.329
