00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:22.939
<v Grace Liu>Exactly.</v>

00:07:24.529 --> 00:07:32.230
<v Callum Reid>Jamie, once you've scheduled downtime for the line two with production by the end of the week, shove it in Teams, yeah?</v>

00:07:34.439 --> 00:07:38.990
